  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p><strong>Prerequisite:</strong> Runes class feature.</p>\n<p><strong>Benefit:</strong> When you use a rune, you may expend your martial focus to unleash a battlecry. This scream is a word that represents your rune in an ancient language and when spoken, increases the power of your rune. If you are attacking with the rune, increase the number of damage dice to your class level (minimum 2). The DC of any saving throw associated with the attack receives a +4 circumstance bonus. If you are moving with the rune, your speed doubles for that move. You may not use this ability if you can not speak or if you are currently deaf.</p>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/runesinger#toc21\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
      "instructions": ""
    },
